---
// Viewport Digital LLC - Pricing Matrix & Service Tiers (Mobile-Optimized Header)
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Complete Pricing Matrix & Services | Viewport Digital LLC</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: dark;
				--bg-canvas: #090A0F;
				--surface-glass: #13161F;
				--accent-amber: #FF5C00;
				--text-primary: #F8FAFC;
				--text-secondary: #94A3B8;
				--border-frost: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
			}

			* { box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }

			body {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
				background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
				color: var(--text-primary);
				line-height: 1.6;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			header {
				position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
				backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
				background-color: rgba(9, 10, 15, 0.85);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
			}

			.container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

			.header-content {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				height: 80px;
				gap: 16px;
			}

			.logo {
				font-weight: 800;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.06em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				white-space: nowrap; /* Prevents awkward mobile wrapping */
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 8px;
				flex-shrink: 0;
			}

			.logo-mark {
				width: 8px;
				height: 8px;
				background-color: var(--accent-amber);
				box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-amber);
			}

			.logo span { color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400; }

			nav {
				display: none;
				gap: 24px;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
			}

			@media(min-width: 768px) {
				nav { display: flex; }
			}

			nav a { color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
			nav a:hover { color: #fff; }

			.archival-tag {
				font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--accent-amber); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;
			}
			.archival-tag::before { content: "■"; font-size: 0.5rem; }

			.btn-primary {
				display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 10px 20px;
				background-color: var(--accent-amber); color: #090A0F; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem;
				text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.25);
				white-space: nowrap;
				flex-shrink: 0;
			}
			.btn-primary:hover { background-color: #ff7024; transform: translateY(-2px); }

			.btn-outline {
				display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 24px;
				background-color: var(--surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-frost); color: var(--text-primary);
				font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}
			.btn-outline:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); background-color: #1a1e2b; }

			section { padding: 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-frost); }
			.section-header { max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
			.section-header h1, .section-header h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
			.section-header p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; }

			.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
			@media(min-width: 768px) { .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

			.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
			@media(min-width: 768px) { .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

			.glass-card {
				background: var(--surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
				box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
				backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
				transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
			}
			.glass-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.35); }

			.card-price { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 16px 0 8px 0; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
			.card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
			.card p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px 0; }
			.card-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--accent-amber); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

			.features-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; }
			.features-list li { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }

			footer { padding: 60px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-frost); text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header>
			<div class="container header-content">
				<a href="/" class="logo">
					<div class="logo-mark"></div>
					Viewport Digital <span>LLC</span>
				</a>
				<nav>
					<a href="/">Home</a>
					<a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
					<a href="/photography">Media</a>
				</nav>
				<div><a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Inquire</a></div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main class="container" style="padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="archival-tag">[INDEX // PRICING MATRIX & SERVICE TIERS]</span>
				<h1>Web Infrastructure Tiers.</h1>
				<p>From micro-entry promotional pages to fully custom SSR portals. Zero bloat, absolute performance.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Micro-Entry & Core Tiers Grid -->
			<div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Micro-Entry Tier</span>
						<h3>Digital Business Card / Promo</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$150 – $350</div>
						<p>Perfect for realtors, pop-up events, or quick promotional digital flyers linked to QR codes.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Custom branded single-scroll link page</li>
							<li>Lightning-fast mobile optimization</li>
							<li>Direct call/email & social integration</li>
							<li>Hosted securely on Vercel edge network</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Secure Micro-Build</a>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Tier 1</span>
						<h3>The Local Landing Page</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$750 – $1,200</div>
						<p>Best for single-page sites, local service providers, transport companies, or quick campaign launches.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>High-impact single page on Astro</li>
							<li>Mobile-optimized responsive design</li>
							<li>Formspree contact form integration</li>
							<li>Vercel lightning-fast edge hosting</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Select Tier 1</a>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card" style="border-color: rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.4);">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag" style="color: var(--accent-amber);">Tier 2 • Most Popular</span>
						<h3>Multi-Page Business Core</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$1,800 – $3,200</div>
						<p>Best for small local businesses, professional offices, or trade contractors needing a robust footprint.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Up to 5 custom pages (Home, Services, About, Gallery, Contact)</li>
							<li>Integrated commercial photography assets</li>
							<li>Clean semantic navigation structure</li>
							<li>Top-tier SEO metadata & performance</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary" style="text-align: center;">Select Tier 2 Core</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Tier 3 & Micro Subscriptions -->
			<div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Tier 3</span>
						<h3>Custom Portal & App</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$3,500 – $6,500+</div>
						<p>Best for interactive client onboarding engines, complex multi-step questionnaires, and member workflows.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Astro Server-Side Rendering (SSR) configuration</li>
							<li>Database integration via Supabase</li>
							<li>Secure user authentication systems</li>
							<li>Custom dashboard components built via Cursor/Gemini</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Initiate Portal Build</a>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Micro-Subscriptions</span>
						<h3>Passive Upkeep & Updates</h3>
						<div class="card-price" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 20px;">$20 to $45 / month</div>
						<p>Low-friction recurring services to keep client assets secure and updated without full retainers.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li><strong>DNS & Edge Security Watchdog ($20/mo):</strong> Cloudflare routing, SSL renewal, uptime alerts.</li>
							<li><strong>The Monthly Promo Drop ($45/mo):</strong> Text/email monthly flyer updates; live within 24 hours.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--accent-amber);">Zero Active Maintenance Overhead</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Flexible Financing & Payment Terms -->
			<div class="glass-card" style="padding: 40px; border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3); margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<span class="archival-tag" style="color: #34D399;">[FLEXIBLE FINANCING TERMS]</span>
				<h2 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 12px 0 16px 0;">Alternative Financing & Milestone Plans</h2>
				<p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
					If third-party approval via Klarna is unavailable, Viewport Digital LLC offers structured internal financing to eliminate upfront cash-flow friction:
				</p>
				<div class="grid-2" style="gap: 20px;">
					<div>
						<h3 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">1. The 50/50 Milestone Contract</h3>
						<p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;">Split your project down the middle. 50% upfront to initiate code development, and the final 50% due upon review before domain pointing.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">2. Stripe Manual Installments</h3>
						<p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;">Automated split payments billed securely across three monthly increments directly on file via Stripe. (Hosted on temporary Vercel preview URLs until final settlement).</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Monthly Retainers -->
			<div class="section-header">
				<h2>Monthly Maintenance Retainers.</h2>
				<p>Protect your digital investment with ongoing oversight, monitoring, and proactive updates.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-3">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<h3>Basic Care</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$75 <span style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400;">/mo</span></div>
						<p>Covers monthly framework checks, Vercel deployment upkeep, uptime monitoring, and up to 30 minutes of minor text updates.</p>
					</div>
					<span class="card-tag">Standard Upkeep</span>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<h3>Growth Retainer</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$150 <span style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400;">/mo</span></div>
						<p>Includes standard monitoring plus priority support and up to two (2) hours of minor content edits or fresh asset swaps per month.</p>
					</div>
					<span class="card-tag">Active Growth</span>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<h3>Scale Retainer</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$300 <span style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400;">/mo</span></div>
						<p>Built for dynamic portals; covers active database management, priority same-day bug remediation, and up to four (4) hours of updates.</p>
					</div>
					<span class="card-tag">Enterprise Support</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>

		<footer>&copy; 2026 Viewport Digital LLC. All rights reserved. kiimon@viewportdigitalmedia.com</footer>
	</body>
</html>
